# Oracle-side wholesale cron template (e5-mother / ev-box)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Install on Oracle host:
#   1. mkdir -p ~/.config/everlight && chmod 700 ~/.config/everlight
#   2. cp /AA_MY_DRIVE/03_AUTOMATION_CORE/01_Scripts/secrets.env.example \
#         ~/.config/everlight/secrets.env
#   3. fill in the secrets, then `chmod 600 ~/.config/everlight/secrets.env`
#   4. append THE LINES BELOW to the host's crontab (`crontab -e`)
#
# Role discipline:
#   - Phone (primary): runs the canonical cron. Does NOT set
#     WHOLESALE_REDUNDANCY_ROLE -- defaults to primary.
#   - Oracle (secondary): sets WHOLESALE_REDUNDANCY_ROLE=secondary in its
#     secrets.env so hive_cron_redundancy.should_run() defers to the
#     freshest peer heartbeat (the phone). If the phone heartbeat ages out
#     (>65 min), Oracle takes over the next tick and Slack-alerts.
#
# How failover works:
#   - Both hosts run the SAME cron schedule.
#   - Each tick, wholesale_cron_runner.sh asks should_run(): primary runs,
#     secondary defers if the peer heartbeat is fresh.
#   - Heartbeat files in _state/heartbeats/ sync via git + Syncthing.
#   - Watchdog (every 5 min on both hosts) screams Slack when EVERY host
#     has gone silent > 30 min.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secret-loading helper. Path must match host install location.
# (On Oracle, /home/opc/.config/everlight/secrets.env or /home/ubuntu/...)

# rex_negotiator: every 2 min
*/2 * * * * cd /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/01_BUSINESSES/Everlight_Ventures/Broker_OS/wholesale_agent && . /home/opc/.config/everlight/secrets.env && bash /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/03_AUTOMATION_CORE/01_Scripts/wholesale_cron_runner.sh rex_negotiator_2min python3 rex_negotiator.py >> /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/_logs/rex_negotiator.log 2>&1

# rex_belfort_sequence: hourly
0 * * * * cd /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/01_BUSINESSES/Everlight_Ventures/Broker_OS/wholesale_agent && . /home/opc/.config/everlight/secrets.env && bash /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/03_AUTOMATION_CORE/01_Scripts/wholesale_cron_runner.sh wholesale_hourly python3 rex_belfort_sequence.py >> /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/_logs/rex_7touch.log 2>&1

# Watchdog: every 5 min, alerts Slack when wholesale silent on every host > 30 min
*/5 * * * * . /home/opc/.config/everlight/secrets.env && python3 /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/03_AUTOMATION_CORE/01_Scripts/hive_cron_redundancy.py watchdog wholesale_hourly >> /home/opc/AA_MY_DRIVE/_logs/cron_redundancy_watchdog.log 2>&1
